# ==============================================================================
# PRACTICEHUB REPO COMPREHENSIVE .GITIGNORE
# Covers C#, Node.js, Python, C++, Java, IDEs, databases, OS files, and archives.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. OS & System Junk Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. .NET & C# (Visual Studio / MSBuild)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build results (Crucial to ignore bin/obj to avoid binary/compiled code pollution)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
bld/
[Log]s/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/

# Visual Studio Cache & User Files
.vs/
*.user
*.userprev
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.sln.docstates
*.sln.iml
